{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "4fea8c0e-cb7f-41fe-a410-df1d3886bf98"/*GeometryToMeshBuffers*/,
  "Description": "Compiles CPU-side procedural geometry into GPU mesh buffers for rendering with [DrawMesh].\n\nTriangulates N-gon faces, resolves corner attributes (normals, UVs, colors) into packed vertices, and computes the tangent basis. Buffers are reused and only re-uploaded when the input geometry changes.",
